{"ticker":"VLO","updated":"2026-11-07T02:02:17Z","profile":{"longName":"Valero Energy Corporation","shortName":"Valero Energy Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","country":"United States","website":"https://www.valero.com","fullTimeEmployees":9785,"marketCap":96619511808,"trailingPE":7.8792357,"forwardPE":6.4763584,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.65938836,"pegRatio":1.27,"targetMeanPrice":427.0,"targetHighPrice":530.0,"targetLowPrice":238.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.465,"earningsGrowth":5.768,"grossMargins":0.19519,"operatingMargins":0.20472999,"profitMargins":0.08834,"totalRevenue":146528993280,"beta":0.552,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":461.52,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":159.9,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.37},"summary":"Valero Energy Corporation manufactures, markets, and sells petroleum-based and low-carbon liquid transportation fuels and petrochemical products in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Ireland, Latin America, Mexico, Peru, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Refining, Renewable Diesel, and Ethanol. The company produces California Reformulated Gasoline Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CARBOB) and Conventional Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CBOB) gasolines, CARB diesel, diesel, jet fuel, heating oil, and asphalt; feedstocks; aromatics; sulfur and residual fuel oil; intermediate oils; and sulfur, sweet, and sour crude oils. It sells its refined products through wholesale rack and bulk markets; and through outlets under the Valero, Beacon, Diamond Shamrock, Shamrock, Ultramar, and Texaco brands. The company also owns and operates renewable diesel and ethanol plants, as well as produces and sells renewable diesel, renewable naphtha, and neat sustainable aviation fuel under the Diamond Green Diesel brand name. In addition, it offers ethanol and various co-products, including dry distillers grains, syrup, and inedible distillers corn oil to animal feed customers. The company was formerly known as Valero Refining and Marketing Company and changed its name to Valero Energy Corporation in August 1997. Valero Energy Corporation was founded in 1980 and ","summary_zh":"瓦萊羅能源公司在美國、加拿大、英國、愛爾蘭、拉丁美洲、墨西哥、秘魯和國際上生產、行銷和銷售石油基低碳液體運輸燃料和石化產品。它透過三個部門運作：煉油部門、再生柴油部門和乙醇部門。該公司生產用於含氧化合物調合的加州新配方汽油調合原料 (CARBOB) 和用於含氧化合物調合的常規調合原料 (CBOB) 汽油、CARB 柴油、柴油、噴氣燃料、取暖油和瀝青；原料；芳烴；硫磺和渣油；中間油；以及硫磺、甜酸原油。透過批發貨架和散裝市場銷售其精煉產品；以及 Valero、Beacon、Diamond Shamrock、Shamrock、Ultramar 和 Texaco 品牌下的經銷店。該公司還擁有並經營再生柴油和乙醇工廠，並以 Diamond Green Diesel 品牌生產和銷售再生柴油、再生石腦油和純永續航空燃料。此外，該公司也向動物飼料客戶提供乙醇和各種副產品，包括乾酒糟、糖漿和非食用酒糟玉米油。公司前身為瓦萊羅煉油行銷公司，1997年8月更名為瓦萊羅能源公司。瓦萊羅能源公司成立於1980年，","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油與天然氣精煉與行銷","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":156.87,"h":157.55,"l":153.62,"c":157.36,"v":2458900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":158.6,"h":163.02,"l":157.14,"c":161.83,"v":3869200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":161.23,"h":162.71,"l":153.6,"c":158.5,"v":4199400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":158.08,"h":160.4,"l":157.05,"c":157.59,"v":2621100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":158.63,"h":159.28,"l":156.35,"c":156.72,"v":1642600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":157.1,"h":159.42,"l":155.8,"c":157.57,"v":2080800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":159.37,"h":163.34,"l":158.65,"c":162.64,"v":2920600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":162.02,"h":165.65,"l":161.7,"c":163.67,"v":2892200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":164.35,"h":164.35,"l":160.35,"c":163.85,"v":2492500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":163.43,"h":163.73,"l":161.1,"c":162.62,"v":8119400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":162.63,"h":167.08,"l":161.93,"c":166.44,"v":2613000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":166.7,"h":172.03,"l":166.7,"c":170.39,"v":4022400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":170.99,"h":173.76,"l":170.8,"c":170.83,"v":3523400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":171.09,"h":176.02,"l":170.37,"c":174.42,"v":4094100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":174.83,"h":178.43,"l":174.08,"c":175.63,"v":3032400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":175.0,"h":175.0,"l":170.14,"c":172.14,"v":2604700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":170.31,"h":172.08,"l":168